The test scenario:

- Starting from "Friday 20 November", pressing ArrowRight should select Monday 23 November, skipping Saturday/Sunday (closed weekend days).
But currently, ArrowRight moves to Saturday? Actually observed: After pressing ArrowRight, the expected value was ["2026-11-23"] but observed was ["2026-11-21"]. Let's check dates: In November 2026, what day-of-week?

Let’s compute: 2026-11-20 is given as starting point (Friday?). They said "From Friday 20 November". So indeed 2026-11-20 is Friday. Then ArrowRight should go to next day (Saturday?) But they want to skip weekends, moving to Monday 23 Nov. However observed gave 2026-11-21 (which is Saturday). Wait maybe they started at some other date? Let's examine observed step details.

